{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_goblin_camp","model_identifier":"lair_goblin_camp","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_goblin_camp\n\nLair: goblin camp (C6, goblins).\n\nA scruffy goblin camp on trampled earth: three scrap tents of patchwork hides (stepped tiers with ridge poles and dark door flaps), a firepit ringed with stones with crossed burning logs, glowing embers (`glow_embers`, `fx_fire`, `fx_smoke`) and meat on a spit, a crooked totem of offset logs daubed with red and yellow paint and topped with horns and a skull, a junk pile, a crate and a spear rack. Footprint 14 x 12 terrain columns (224 x 192 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 46 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -100.0..100.0, y 0.0..84.0, z -90.0..91.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- tents: 54 x 50 x 70 at (-56, 30); 64 x 42 x 48 at (58, 36); 40 x 34 x 34 at (10, 70) (w x h x d, from y = 0)\n- totem: 12 x 84 x 12 at (-30, -50); firepit 40 x 8 x 40 at (4, -22) (walk-around)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_fire` on `root` at (4, 8, -22)\n- `fx_smoke` on `root` at (4, 26, -22)\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 0, 30)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_fire` / `fx_smoke`: the firepit (fire light, smoke puffs); `fx_spawn`: between the tents.\n- Lit cube: glow_embers.\n- This lair is section C; goblin village buildings (hut, totem, fire pit, wolf pen) belong to another section and were not touched.\n- Destroyed version: `lair_goblin_camp_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n"},"description":"# lair_goblin_camp\n\nLair: goblin camp (C6, goblins).\n\nA scruffy goblin camp on trampled earth: three scrap tents of patchwork hides (stepped tiers with ridge poles and dark door flaps), a firepit ringed with stones with crossed burning logs, glowing embers (`glow_embers`, `fx_fire`, `fx_smoke`) and meat on a spit, a crooked totem of offset logs daubed with red and yellow paint and topped with horns and a skull, a junk pile, a crate and a spear rack. Footprint 14 x 12 terrain columns (224 x 192 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 46 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -100.0..100.0, y 0.0..84.0, z -90.0..91.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- tents: 54 x 50 x 70 at (-56, 30); 64 x 42 x 48 at (58, 36); 40 x 34 x 34 at (10, 70) (w x h x d, from y = 0)\n- totem: 12 x 84 x 12 at (-30, -50); firepit 40 x 8 x 40 at (4, -22) (walk-around)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_fire` on `root` at (4, 8, -22)\n- `fx_smoke` on `root` at (4, 26, -22)\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 0, 30)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_fire` / `fx_smoke`: the firepit (fire light, smoke puffs); `fx_spawn`: between the tents.\n- Lit cube: glow_embers.\n- This lair is section C; goblin village buildings (hut, totem, fire pit, wolf pen) belong to another section and were not touched.\n- Destroyed version: `lair_goblin_camp_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"trampled_ground","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-100.0,0.0,-90.0],"to":[100.0,0.5,90.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,440,200.0,440.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,442,180.0,442.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,441,200.0,441.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,443,180.0,443.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,200.0,180.0],"texture":0},"down":